        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi nama d'ugaafi qajeeluma gula deemu ineebisaafi. AABBO Waaqi arra ya harka kiyyati si kenne, ammo anini nama inni muude hayyu tolche tuqu dide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
